(c) over the same period, the percentage increase in prices of petroleum products;
(d) over the last five years, the amount collected by taxing petrol and diesel and the number of times excise duty revised and hikes effected; and
(e) the steps taken to accelerate the push towards energy security?

(a) the percentage of rural land records digitized so far, state-wise;
(b) the present status of e-court integration of land records so far;
