(c) whether curtailment of renewable energy has emerged as a challenge for clean energy transition; and
(d) if so, the steps proposed to be taken to accelerate transmission infrastructure to minimise renewable energy curtailment with a view to increase grid’s ability to absorb the renewable energy?

