(d) if so, the details thereof in terms of percentage including the quantum of raw cotton and yarn being imported;
(e) whether the shortfall of cotton likely to increase pressure on spinning mills and downstream textile industries; and
(f) the relief measures proposed to be extended to the textile industry?

